+  // Numerical result in the current graph gauge. A usable Ceres termination is
+  // separate from transaction acceptance and from a free-gradient stopping test.
+  // Gradients are derivatives of the whitened objective in world metres/radians;
+  // their mixed-unit norm is not a physical trajectory-accuracy claim.
+  struct ObjectiveEvaluation
